# 🌦️ Weather Live - Real-Time Weather Application

A dynamic and interactive weather web application developed as **Task 5** of my **Web Development Internship at Prodigy Infotech**.

The application fetches real-time weather information based on the user's searched city or current location and presents it through an interactive **live weather broadcast-style interface** featuring animated clouds, sun, moon, rain, and a weather reporter.

---

## 🚀 Features

* 🌍 Search weather by city name
* 📍 Detect weather using the user's current location
* 🌡️ Display current temperature
* ☁️ Display weather condition and cloud coverage
* 💧 Display humidity
* 💨 Display wind speed
* 🌧️ Display rainfall information
* ☀️ Animated moving sun
* ☁️ Continuously moving clouds
* 🌙 Animated moon and stars during nighttime
* 🌧️ Animated rainfall during rainy conditions
* 🎙️ Weather reporter with microphone
* 💬 Live weather announcement
* 🔊 Text-to-speech weather announcement
* 🔄 Automatic weather data refresh
* 📱 Responsive design for different screen sizes
* ✨ Glassmorphism-style weather interface

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

* HTML5
* CSS3
* JavaScript
* Open-Meteo Weather API
* Open-Meteo Geocoding API
* Browser Geolocation API
* Web Speech API
* VS Code
* Live Server
* Git & GitHub

---

## 🌐 API Used

This project uses **Open-Meteo** to retrieve weather information.

### Weather API

https://api.open-meteo.com/

### Geocoding API

https://geocoding-api.open-meteo.com/

The application uses the geocoding service to convert a city name into latitude and longitude coordinates and then retrieves the corresponding weather data.

**No API key is required for this project.**

