## 📸 Project Highlights

This project provides a visually interactive weather experience rather than displaying weather information as a simple static card.

It combines:

* Real-time weather data
* Animated environmental effects
* Location-based weather
* Voice announcements
* Interactive city search
* Dynamic weather backgrounds
* Responsive user interface

to create a weather broadcast-style web application.

